      "code": "int binarySearch(int arr[], int l, int r, int target){\n    if( l > r )\n        return -1;\n\n    int mid = l + (r-l)/2;\n    if( arr[mid] == target )\n        return mid;\n    else if( arr[mid] > target )\n        return binarySearch(arr, l, mid-1, target);\n    else\n        return binarySearch(arr, mid+1, r, target);\n}",
